Z||000004||WhiteFieroBlur||11-04-2001||10:30 PM||||I burn CDs all the time with hardly any troubles. What I use it MusicMatch to listen to my music on my PC and burn them. It already had built into it CD burner capabilities. You just make your play list of the MP3 you downlaoded from morpheus or whatever and hit the record CD-R button and it does the rest. It has many added features to try and keep up with CD quality replay||||reg||1
